refactor(raw): drop Raw.ReportId; track arrivals by RawId



Raw.ReportId was never written and always held an empty string.

Populating it at the endpoint would have required a second parse,

with rules that could disagree with the Processor's deserializer.



Raw records arrivals only; the business identity lives in ODS

(Reports.ReportId). Normal tracing goes through Reports.RawId back

to Raw. Resubmissions and failed records are arrival-level anomalies

and are investigated directly on Raw.Payload via JSON_VALUE.



- RawModel: remove ReportId property

- Migration RemoveRawReportId: drop column Raw.ReportId

- TryClaimRawTest: remove ReportId from seed data

- Add ADR-0001



Refs: ADR-0001
